  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wahab &amp; Co to review RHSTEP and BAPSA</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Wahab &amp; Co to review RHSTEP and BAPSA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EMB i Sverige Dhaka avser att genomf&#xf6;ra en utv&#xe4;rdering av institutionella- och ekonomiska f&#xf6;rvaltningskapaciteten hos RHSTEP och BAPSA, inklusive kapacitet inom internkontroll och f&#xf6;rvaltning enligt bifogad ToR bilaga 1 innan undertecknande av avtalet med RHSTEP och BAPSA f&#xf6;r perioden 2017-2021, Taget fr&#xe5;n bidraget nr 10757. EMB / Dhaka med st&#xf6;d av Wahab och Co. genomf&#xf6;r &#xf6;versikten genom ramavtalet mellan ambassaden och Wahab och Co.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EMB of Sweden Dhaka intends to conduct an assesment of institutional and financial management capacity of RHSTEP and BAPSA which includes internal control and management according to attached ToR appendix 1 before signing the agreement with RHSTEP and BAPSA for the period of 2017-2021 , taken from  the contribution No 10757. EMB/Dhaka with the support of Wahab and Co. carries thorugh the review via frame work agreement between the Embassy and Wahab and Co.</narrative>
  </description>
